Package: libsecret-1-0
Version: @DEB_LIBSECRET_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/libsecret
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libgcrypt20, libgpg-error0
Description: Secret Service D-Bus client library
 libsecret stores and retrieves passwords and other secrets through the
 freedesktop Secret Service D-Bus API (gnome-keyring and compatible daemons).
 Includes the secret-tool command line client.
